// Shared Syncthing ignore rules for this folder. This file is synced to every
// device; each device's own .stignore loads it with "#include .stglobalignore".
// Created by the dotfiles (machine/syncthing/stglobalignore) when the folder had none;
// the dotfiles never change it afterwards.
// To sync something listed here anyway, add "!<path>" ABOVE the rules (first match wins).
// Synology folders.
(?d)@eaDir
(?d)#recycle
(?d)#snapshot
// Build output and dependency caches: rebuilt locally, never worth syncing.
(?d)**/target
(?d)**/node_modules
(?d)**/.venv
(?d)**/__pycache__
(?d)**/.pytest_cache
(?d)**/.mypy_cache
(?d)**/.ruff_cache
(?d)**/.nox
(?d)**/.tox
// Git worktrees of Claude Code sessions; without (?d), so Syncthing never deletes one.
**/.claude/worktrees
